{%- comment -%}
  al_folio_core's bib.liquid includes this hook for every entry, right after it
  builds the venue text (`entrytype`), with `entry` in scope (docs/CUSTOMIZE.md).

  This site does not show the venue line ("In Proceedings of ..., Mar 2026"):
  the venue badge and the year headings already say where and when. The line
  keeps only the entry's `additional_info` (for example "ERA Track", or a
  link to the slides of a second talk), so entries without it get no line.
  Clearing the month and year stops bib.liquid from appending them.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture entrytype -%}
  {%- if entry.additional_info -%}
    {{- entry.additional_info | markdownify | remove: '<p>' | remove: '</p>' | strip -}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign entrymonth = '' -%}
{%- assign entryyear = '' -%}
